            ]
          },
          "docs": "Deletes an Operator Control. You cannot delete an Operator Control if it is assigned to govern any target resource currently or in the future.\nIn that case, first, delete all of the current and future assignments before deleting the Operator Control. An Operator Control that was previously assigned to a target \nresource is marked as DELETED following a successful deletion. However, it is not completely deleted from the system. This is to ensure auditing information for the accesses \ndone under t"
        },
